### 3. gold.fact_appointment

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Column Name</th>
      <th>Data Type</th>
      <th>Description</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>appointment_key</td><td>INT</td><td>Primary surrogate key for the fact record.</td></tr>
